{"id":"953666dcda2baf50","group":"90","path":"90/90-cor-godel-sound.md","title":"Gödel Sentence is True","display":"cor-godel-sound — Gödel Sentence is True","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-cor-godel-sound","aliases":["90-cor-godel-sound"],"display":"cor-godel-sound — Gödel Sentence is True","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-godel-sentence]]","[[90-thm-first-incompleteness]]","[[90-df-soundness-theory]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-cor-godel-sound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-cor-godel-sound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-godel-sound — Gödel Sentence is True"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a383d3d0b123595\" href=\"?note=5a383d3d0b123595\" title=\"90-thm-first-incompleteness\">90-thm-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a14c33ea0c47a173\" href=\"?note=a14c33ea0c47a173\" title=\"90-df-soundness-theory\">90-df-soundness-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(g,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span>；标准模型是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a> 的结构（若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 有额外符号，取其指定的标准算术扩张）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (effectively axiomatized arithmetical theory with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\\)</span> (standard-model soundness predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sound}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models G\\land T\\nvdash G\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sound}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models G\\land T\\nvdash G\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>可靠性排除矛盾句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span>，故第一不完备性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash G\">\\(T\\nvdash G\\)</span>。真实证明码对应使标准模型满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\\)</span>；可靠性把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可证的 Gödel 等价送入模型，得到该模型满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准模型可靠性使固定点等价可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中正确解释，并蕴含排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 可证所需的一致性。</li>\n<li>该推论展示语义真与理论可证性的分离。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"5a383d3d0b123595","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-thm-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-soundness-theory","status":"resolved","id":"a14c33ea0c47a173","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-soundness-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一 $g,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T$；标准模型是 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的结构（若 $S$ 有额外符号，取其指定的标准算术扩张）。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一 $g,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T$；标准模型是 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的结构（若 $S$ 有额外符号，取其指定的标准算术扩张）。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sound}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models G\\land T\\nvdash G\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"0=1","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash G","display":false